# 🔐 Release signing material must NEVER be committed.
# CI restores it from GitHub Secrets (KEYSTORE_B64, KEYSTORE_PASSWORD;
# alias "fandoghi" is fixed in the workflow). See KEYSTORE_ROTATION_GUIDE.md.
key.properties
*.keystore
*.jks

